r":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-02-12T11:55:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T17:07:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3-stable\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - macOS 12.7.6 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) HD Graphics 6000 - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-5350U CPU @ 1.80GHz (4 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn macOS, a fullscreen game will briefly accelerate and lose sync (for example with music) when a system overlay appear, like the audio or brightness indicators. This only happens with vsync enabled. Fps will go from 60 to 120.\n\nI'm actually creating a rhytm game and this breaks the sync.\n\nThe bug also happens when \"moving\" the fullscreen game with 4 fingers on the touchpad.\n\ntested on macOS 12.7.6, sorry I could not test with more recent macOS versions.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTest with the physics-platformer-demo. Try running in a place with enough space and press the a volume keyboard button. The player will briefly speed up and the go back to the normal speed.\n\nThis happens with the Forward+ and Mobile rendering method. It does not happen with gl_compatibility.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n physics-platformer-demo","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102761/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102761/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}